<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Firstone Int'l shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Firstone Int'l shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of capacitors maker Firstone International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares ended HK$0.04 higher at HK$0.52 per share on Friday on volume of 10.04 million shares.</p>
<p>Last week, the company reported a net loss of HK$87.38 million for the ended in December 1996, compared with a HK$2.11 million profit a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370  http://www.hk97.com</p>
